<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #212529; line-height: 1.5;">
    <h2>Withdrawal Request Rejected</h2>
    <p>Hello {{name}},</p>
    <p>
      Your wallet withdrawal request of <strong>₹{{amount}}</strong> has been
      <strong>rejected</strong>. The reserved amount has been released back to your available
      wallet balance.
    </p>
    <p><b>Request ID:</b> {{requestId}}</p>
    {{#if adminRemarks}}
    <p><b>Reason:</b> {{adminRemarks}}</p>
    {{/if}}
    <p>You may submit a new withdrawal request from your wallet if needed.</p>
  </body>
</html>
